        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI 122x203AMx902, 122 Levers with 2\" Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAHI 122 Lever is solid stainless steel making it resistant to corrosion, knocks, scratches, and abrasions. Small  2\" Square Roses are surface mounted and include spring assist cassettes. Non-handed reversible for left or right doors. This set is used with <b>Mortise Lock Sets</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG122-204-specifications.gif?v=1704354721\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" atl=\"AHI-SIG122-204 Specifications\">\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> AHI 122x203AMx902:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-5/16\" (135 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Width: 3/4\" (20 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Thickness: 3/4\" (20 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/16\" (55 mm)</li>\r\n<li>902 Spindle Width: 0.31\" (8 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose: 2\" (50 mm) squared</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n*Set includes (2) 122 Levers, (2) 203AM 2\" Surface Mounted Roses & (1) 8mm Solid Spindle.\r\n</p>",
